      "name": "Fontaine's Inspectionless Malfs",
      "slug": "fontaines-inspectionless-malfs",
      "teaser": "Makes it so you don't need to inspect/examine malfunctions before clearing them.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/661.jpg",
      "downloads": 30847,
      "favourites_count": 3,
      "description": "<h3><strong>Inspectionless Malfs:</strong></h3>\n<p>Makes it so you do not need to inspect/examine malfunctions before clearing them. That’s it. Nothing more, nothing less.</p>\n<p>If you want to remove the glow indicators for malfunctions, it’s in the setting’s “Game” tab.</p>\n<p>To install, simply put the .dll file into your BepInEx/Plugins folder</p>\n<h3><strong>Known Issues:</strong></h3>\n<p>If you spam the keybind for clearing malfunctions while reloading while having a malfunction your hands will freeze. Just don’t spam the clear malf keybind while reloading and you’ll never encounter this.</p>\n<p><strong>NOTE: THIS IS ALREADY INCLUDED IN SPT REALISM MOD. DO NOT INSTALL BOTH!</strong></p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/465/fontaines-inspectionless-malfs",
